{
  "reason": "Changing one conversation's source must not change existing conversations; new conversations snapshot the latest complete choice. Desktop reconfiguration drops a stale config-file model pin when a source is selected; direct explicit per-request model overrides remain supported. Local Ultra wins over normalized provider effort so publishing a model cannot erase orchestration. Cursor persists exact concrete model variants, including effort and Fast, without changing other conversations. Every inference replacement carries verbosity, reasoning summary and search access, including explicit default resets.",
